  "projectName": "Kafka Learning",
  "projectDescription": "A Java-based hands-on reference project demonstrating Apache Kafka fundamentals — producers, consumers, topic management, Avro serialization, JSON Schema, Schema Registry integration, and dynamic schema inference — targeting Confluent Cloud and local Kafka clusters.",
